      55.05,
      521.46,
      295.3,
      565.26
    ],
    "text": "I, Gayantha Karunatilleke, Minister of Lands and ParliamentaryReforms, hereby declare, under Sub-section (1) of Section 5 of the LandAcquisition Act, that the land described below is needed for a publicpurpose and will be acquired under the provisions of that Act.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      9.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      55.05,
      577.86,
      295.33,
      644.46
    ],
    "text": "An allotment of Land depicted in the Advance Tracing No. Ya/TLL/2018/41 dated 30.06.2018 prepared by the Surveyor Generalsituated in the village called Thellippalai East in the Grama NiladariDivision No. J/229 of Thurkapuram, in the Divisional Secretary'sDivision of Valikamam North of Jaffna District in Northern provinceand bounded as follows:",
